      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Automated Brazil Pix ISPB, COMPE & CVM Financial Institution KYB Auditor Pipeline (Daily B2B M2M Workflow)\n\n**Overview:**\nAudits Brazilian banks, payment institutions, and FinTechs against official Central Bank SPI Pix (ISPB) and COMPE directories. Verifies direct vs. indirect settlement participation, operational status, and AML/KYB Risk Scores (0-100).\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [b2b-quant-apis/brazil-pix-ispb-cvm-financial-kyb-auditor](https://apify.com/b2b-quant-apis/brazil-pix-ispb-cvm-financial-kyb-auditor)\n\n### Quick Setup (2 Minutes):\n1. Create a free Apify account and copy your personal token from **Settings -> Integrations**.\n2. Open the **Apify Engine: brazil-pix-ispb-cvm-financial-kyb-auditor** HTTP Request node and configure a **Header Auth** credential with:\n   - **Name:** `Authorization`\n   - **Value:** `Bearer <YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN_HERE>`\n3. Customize the JSON input payload in the HTTP Request node and set your destination Webhook/Slack URL.\n4. Toggle the workflow **Active** to run automatically every morning at 07:00 AM!",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "b63119b6-4f21-54dd-8c97-9fd2198792cc",
      "name": "Setup Instructions & Architecture",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 7 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "8acfcdf0-0c7a-5d3f-92f4-6ee7e827bb8a",
      "name": "Daily 07:00 AM Schedule Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        220,
        520
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/b2b-quant-apis~brazil-pix-ispb-cvm-financial-kyb-auditor/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"institutionQuery\": \"Banco\",\n  \"onlyDirectPix\": true,\n  \"maxResults\": 10\n}",
